{"id":50957,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50957"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:13:37","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:13:37","slug":"lidl-sao-silvestre-lisboa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lidl-sao-silvestre-lisboa\/","title":{"rendered":"Lidl S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lisboa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lidl S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lisboa 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Lidl S\u00e3o Silvestre de Lisboa 2026<\/strong> (19\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>26 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, \u00e0s <strong>21:30<\/strong>, tendo como ponto nevr\u00e1lgico a emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Avenida da Liberdade<\/strong> e a <strong>Pra\u00e7a dos Restauradores<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Inspirada este ano no universo liter\u00e1rio de Fernando Pessoa sob o mote de partilhar o Sonho ao ritmo da capital, a cl\u00e1ssica noturna lisboeta re\u00fane milhares de atletas num espet\u00e1culo de luz, m\u00fasica e competi\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento apresenta um percurso oficial homologado de <strong>10 km<\/strong> em asfalto, descendo dos Restauradores e do <strong>Rossio<\/strong> pela <strong>Baixa Pombalina<\/strong> at\u00e9 ao <strong>Cais do Sodr\u00e9<\/strong> e <strong>Avenida 24 de Julho<\/strong>, regressando pela <strong>Ribeira das Naus<\/strong> e <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio<\/strong> antes da exigente subida da <strong>Avenida da Liberdade<\/strong> at\u00e9 ao <strong>Marqu\u00eas de Pombal<\/strong> e chegada nos Restauradores. O programa mant\u00e9m a c\u00e9lebre competi\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Guerra dos Sexos<\/strong> (onde a elite feminina parte com vantagem cronometrada sobre a elite masculina) e partidas faseadas por blocos de tempo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Clube Ol\u00edmpico de Oeiras<\/strong> e pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lisboa<\/strong>, com dire\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>HMS Sports<\/strong>, a prova integra tamb\u00e9m o <strong>Campeonato S\u00e3o Silvestre<\/strong> em conjunto com a S\u00e3o Silvestre da Amadora, garantindo kit com camisola t\u00e9cnica <em>long-sleeve<\/em>, abastecimentos aos 5 km e na meta, e medalha comemorativa. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Dezembro de 2026 \u00e0s 21:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida da Liberdade, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; f